w: To the | work! To the work! We are | serv-ants of God, Let us | fol-low the path that our | Mas-ter has trod; With the | balm of His coun-sel our | strength to re-new, Let us | do with our might what our | hands find to do. Toil-ing | on, toil-ing | on, Toil-ing | on, toil-ing | on; Let us | hope, let us | watch, And | la-bor till the Mas-ter | comes.
